### Story Quest API - Comprehensive Chapters & Units Testing (Day 2)
### This file tests all enhanced endpoints with role-based access control
### Prerequisites: Run auth.http first to get tokens for all roles

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@contentType = application/json

### TOKENS - Update these after logging in with auth.http
@agencyToken = your_agency_token_here
@centerToken = your_center_token_here
@teacherToken = your_teacher_token_here
@studentToken = your_student_token_here

### Test IDs (update after creating resources)
@chapterId1 = 1
@chapterId2 = 2
@chapterId3 = 3
@unitId1 = 1
@unitId2 = 2
@unitId3 = 3

################################################################################
# CHAPTERS API - COMPREHENSIVE TESTING (18 test cases)
################################################################################

### ============================================================================
### C1. GET ALL CHAPTERS (Student view with progress)
### Role: STUDENT | Expected: 200 OK
### ============================================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/chapters
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### ============================================================================
### C2. GET ALL CHAPTERS WITH UNITS (include nested units)
### Role: STUDENT | Expected: 200 OK with nested units
### ============================================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/chapters?includeUnits=true
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### ============================================================================
### C3. GET SINGLE CHAPTER BY ID
### Role: STUDENT | Expected: 200 OK
### ============================================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/chapters/{{chapterId1}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### ============================================================================
### C4. GET SINGLE CHAPTER WITH UNITS
### Role: STUDENT | Expected: 200 OK with nested units
### ============================================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/chapters/{{chapterId1}}?includeUnits=true
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### ============================================================================
### C5. CREATE CHAPTER - TEACHER ROLE
### Role: TEACHER | Expected: 201 Created
### ============================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/chapters
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Greetings & Introductions",
  "description": "Learn basic greetings and how to introduce yourself in English",
  "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.example.com/chapters/greetings.jpg",
  "orderIndex": 0,
  "isActive": true
}

### ============================================================================
### C6. CREATE CHAPTER - CENTER ROLE
### Role: CENTER | Expected: 201 Created
### ============================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/chapters
Authorization: Bearer {{centerToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Family & Friends",
  "description": "Learn vocabulary related to family members and friends",
  "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.example.com/chapters/family.jpg",
  "orderIndex": 1,
  "isActive": true
}

### ============================================================================
### C7. CREATE CHAPTER - AGENCY ROLE
### Role: AGENCY | Expected: 201 Created
### ============================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/chapters
Authorization: Bearer {{agencyToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Food & Drinks",
  "description": "Learn common food and drink vocabulary",
  "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.example.com/chapters/food.jpg",
  "orderIndex": 2,
  "isActive": true
}

### ============================================================================
### C8. CREATE CHAPTER - VALIDATION ERROR (missing required fields)
### Role: TEACHER | Expected: 400 Bad Request
### ============================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/chapters
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "description": "Missing title and orderIndex - should fail"
}

### ============================================================================
### C9. CREATE CHAPTER - UNAUTHORIZED (Student role)
### Role: STUDENT | Expected: 403 Forbidden
### ============================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/chapters
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Should Fail - Student Cannot Create",
  "orderIndex": 10
}

### ============================================================================
### C10. UPDATE CHAPTER - TEACHER ROLE
### Role: TEACHER | Expected: 200 OK
### ============================================================================
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/chapters/{{chapterId1}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Greetings & Introductions - Updated by Teacher",
  "description": "Enhanced description for greetings chapter"
}

### ============================================================================
### C11. UPDATE CHAPTER - CENTER ROLE
### Role: CENTER | Expected: 200 OK
### ============================================================================
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/chapters/{{chapterId1}}
Authorization: Bearer {{centerToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "isActive": false
}

### ============================================================================
### C12. UPDATE CHAPTER - AGENCY ROLE
### Role: AGENCY | Expected: 200 OK
### ============================================================================
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/chapters/{{chapterId2}}
Authorization: Bearer {{agencyToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "orderIndex": 5
}

### ============================================================================
### C13. UPDATE CHAPTER - NOT FOUND
### Role: TEACHER | Expected: 404 Not Found
### ============================================================================
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/chapters/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Non-existent Chapter"
}

### ============================================================================
### C14. BULK REORDER CHAPTERS - SUCCESS
### Role: TEACHER | Expected: 200 OK with success message
### ============================================================================
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/chapters/reorder/bulk
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "chapters": [
    { "id": 1, "orderIndex": 2 },
    { "id": 2, "orderIndex": 0 },
    { "id": 3, "orderIndex": 1 }
  ]
}

### ============================================================================
### C15. BULK REORDER - VALIDATION ERROR (negative orderIndex)
### Role: TEACHER | Expected: 400 Bad Request
### ============================================================================
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/chapters/reorder/bulk
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "chapters": [
    { "id": 1, "orderIndex": -1 }
  ]
}

### ============================================================================
### C16. BULK REORDER - NOT FOUND
### Role: TEACHER | Expected: 404 Not Found
### ============================================================================
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/chapters/reorder/bulk
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "chapters": [
    { "id": 99999, "orderIndex": 0 }
  ]
}

### ============================================================================
### C17. DELETE CHAPTER - AGENCY ROLE (only allowed role)
### Role: AGENCY | Expected: 204 No Content
### ============================================================================
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/chapters/{{chapterId3}}
Authorization: Bearer {{agencyToken}}

### ============================================================================
### C18. DELETE CHAPTER - FORBIDDEN (Teacher role)
### Role: TEACHER | Expected: 403 Forbidden
### ============================================================================
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/chapters/{{chapterId1}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

################################################################################
# UNITS API - COMPREHENSIVE TESTING (18 test cases)
################################################################################

### ============================================================================
### U1. GET ALL UNITS (all units across chapters)
### Role: STUDENT | Expected: 200 OK
### ============================================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/units
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### ============================================================================
### U2. GET UNITS BY CHAPTER ID (filter by chapter)
### Role: STUDENT | Expected: 200 OK
### ============================================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/units?chapterId={{chapterId1}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### ============================================================================
### U3. GET UNITS WITH LEVELS (include nested levels)
### Role: STUDENT | Expected: 200 OK
### ============================================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/units?chapterId={{chapterId1}}&includeLevels=true
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### ============================================================================
### U4. GET SINGLE UNIT BY ID
### Role: STUDENT | Expected: 200 OK
### ============================================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/units/{{unitId1}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### ============================================================================
### U5. GET SINGLE UNIT WITH LEVELS
### Role: STUDENT | Expected: 200 OK
### ============================================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/units/{{unitId1}}?includeLevels=true
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### ============================================================================
### U6. CREATE UNIT - TEACHER ROLE
### Role: TEACHER | Expected: 201 Created
### ============================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/units
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "chapterId": {{chapterId1}},
  "title": "Greeting Friends",
  "description": "Learn how to greet friends in casual situations",
  "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.example.com/units/greeting-friends.jpg",
  "orderIndex": 0,
  "isActive": true
}

### ============================================================================
### U7. CREATE UNIT - CENTER ROLE
### Role: CENTER | Expected: 201 Created
### ============================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/units
Authorization: Bearer {{centerToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "chapterId": {{chapterId1}},
  "title": "Formal Greetings",
  "description": "Learn formal greetings for professional settings",
  "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.example.com/units/formal-greetings.jpg",
  "orderIndex": 1,
  "isActive": true
}

### ============================================================================
### U8. CREATE UNIT - AGENCY ROLE
### Role: AGENCY | Expected: 201 Created
### ============================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/units
Authorization: Bearer {{agencyToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "chapterId": {{chapterId1}},
  "title": "Saying Goodbye",
  "description": "Learn different ways to say goodbye",
  "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.example.com/units/goodbye.jpg",
  "orderIndex": 2,
  "isActive": true
}

### ============================================================================
### U9. CREATE UNIT - VALIDATION ERROR (negative orderIndex)
### Role: TEACHER | Expected: 400 Bad Request
### ============================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/units
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "chapterId": {{chapterId1}},
  "title": "Invalid Unit",
  "description": "This has invalid orderIndex",
  "orderIndex": -1
}

### ============================================================================
### U10. CREATE UNIT - INVALID CHAPTER ID
### Role: TEACHER | Expected: 404 Not Found
### ============================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/units
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "chapterId": 99999,
  "title": "Unit with Invalid Chapter",
  "description": "Parent chapter doesn't exist",
  "orderIndex": 0
}

### ============================================================================
### U11. CREATE UNIT - UNAUTHORIZED (Student role)
### Role: STUDENT | Expected: 403 Forbidden
### ============================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/units
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "chapterId": {{chapterId1}},
  "title": "Should Fail - Student Cannot Create",
  "orderIndex": 10
}

### ============================================================================
### U12. UPDATE UNIT - TEACHER ROLE
### Role: TEACHER | Expected: 200 OK
### ============================================================================
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/units/{{unitId1}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Greeting Friends - Updated by Teacher",
  "description": "Enhanced description for greeting friends unit"
}

### ============================================================================
### U13. UPDATE UNIT - CENTER ROLE
### Role: CENTER | Expected: 200 OK
### ============================================================================
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/units/{{unitId1}}
Authorization: Bearer {{centerToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "orderIndex": 5,
  "isActive": true
}

### ============================================================================
### U14. UPDATE UNIT - AGENCY ROLE
### Role: AGENCY | Expected: 200 OK
### ============================================================================
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/units/{{unitId2}}
Authorization: Bearer {{agencyToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.example.com/units/new-thumbnail.jpg"
}

### ============================================================================
### U15. UPDATE UNIT - NOT FOUND
### Role: TEACHER | Expected: 404 Not Found
### ============================================================================
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/units/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Non-existent Unit"
}

### ============================================================================
### U16. DELETE UNIT - AGENCY ROLE (only allowed role)
### Role: AGENCY | Expected: 204 No Content
### ============================================================================
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/units/{{unitId3}}
Authorization: Bearer {{agencyToken}}

### ============================================================================
### U17. DELETE UNIT - FORBIDDEN (Teacher role)
### Role: TEACHER | Expected: 403 Forbidden
### ============================================================================
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/units/{{unitId1}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

### ============================================================================
### U18. DELETE UNIT - FORBIDDEN (Center role)
### Role: CENTER | Expected: 403 Forbidden
### ============================================================================
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/units/{{unitId1}}
Authorization: Bearer {{centerToken}}

################################################################################
# INTEGRATION SCENARIOS (4 test cases)
################################################################################

### ============================================================================
### I1. CREATE CHAPTER AND UNITS WORKFLOW - Step 1: Create Chapter
### Role: TEACHER | Expected: 201 Created
### ============================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/chapters
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Colors & Shapes",
  "description": "Learn basic colors and shapes vocabulary",
  "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.example.com/chapters/colors.jpg",
  "orderIndex": 10,
  "isActive": true
}

### ============================================================================
### I2. CREATE CHAPTER AND UNITS WORKFLOW - Step 2: Create First Unit
### Role: TEACHER | Expected: 201 Created
### NOTE: Update chapterId after Step 1
### ============================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/units
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "chapterId": 4,
  "title": "Basic Colors",
  "description": "Red, blue, yellow, and more!",
  "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.example.com/units/basic-colors.jpg",
  "orderIndex": 0,
  "isActive": true
}

### ============================================================================
### I3. CREATE CHAPTER AND UNITS WORKFLOW - Step 3: Create Second Unit
### Role: TEACHER | Expected: 201 Created
### ============================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/units
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "chapterId": 4,
  "title": "Common Shapes",
  "description": "Circle, square, triangle, and more!",
  "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.example.com/units/common-shapes.jpg",
  "orderIndex": 1,
  "isActive": true
}

### ============================================================================
### I4. CREATE CHAPTER AND UNITS WORKFLOW - Step 4: Get Chapter with Units
### Role: STUDENT | Expected: 200 OK with nested units
### ============================================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/chapters/4?includeUnits=true
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

################################################################################
# AUTHENTICATION & AUTHORIZATION TESTS (4 test cases)
################################################################################

### ============================================================================
### A1. NO AUTHENTICATION - Chapters
### Expected: 401 Unauthorized
### ============================================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/chapters

### ============================================================================
### A2. NO AUTHENTICATION - Units
### Expected: 401 Unauthorized
### ============================================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/units

### ============================================================================
### A3. INVALID TOKEN - Chapters
### Expected: 401 Unauthorized
### ============================================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/chapters
Authorization: Bearer invalid_token_here

### ============================================================================
### A4. INVALID TOKEN - Units
### Expected: 401 Unauthorized
### ============================================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/units
Authorization: Bearer invalid_token_here

################################################################################
# TEST SUMMARY
################################################################################

# Total Test Cases: 44
#
# Chapters API: 18 tests
# ␀ Read operations: 4 tests (GET all, GET by ID, with/without nested units)
# ␀ Create operations: 5 tests (Teacher, Center, Agency, validation error, unauthorized)
# ␀ Update operations: 5 tests (Teacher, Center, Agency, not found)
# ␀ Reorder operations: 3 tests (success, validation error, not found)
# ␀ Delete operations: 1 test (Agency only, forbidden for others)
#
# Units API: 18 tests
# ␀ Read operations: 5 tests (GET all, filter by chapter, with levels, GET by ID)
# ␀ Create operations: 6 tests (Teacher, Center, Agency, validation errors, unauthorized)
# ␀ Update operations: 4 tests (Teacher, Center, Agency, not found)
# ␀ Delete operations: 3 tests (Agency only, forbidden for Teacher and Center)
#
# Integration Tests: 4 tests
# ␀ Full workflow: Create chapter ’ Create units ’ Get chapter with units
#
# Auth Tests: 4 tests
# ␀ No auth, Invalid token for both Chapters and Units
#
################################################################################
# TESTING INSTRUCTIONS
################################################################################

# 1. Start NestJS server: npm run start:dev
# 2. Login with all 4 roles using api-tests/auth.http:
#    - Agency (super admin)
#    - Center (organization admin)
#    - Teacher (instructor)
#    - Student (learner - mobile only)
# 3. Copy tokens to @variables section at top
# 4. Run tests sequentially to verify:
#     Role-based access control works correctly
#     Validation catches errors
#     Progress tracking integrates properly
#     Cascade operations work (delete chapter deletes units)
# 5. Check Swagger docs: http://localhost:3000/api/docs
#
# Expected Results:
# - Students can only READ chapters/units
# - Teachers can CREATE and UPDATE
# - Centers can CREATE and UPDATE
# - Only AGENCY can DELETE
# - All validation errors return 400
# - Authorization errors return 403
# - Not found errors return 404
